(wind-variable-mass-trace)
*title Named RCC-atmosphere wind-file trace
*sixdof
*atmos rcc ktf-annual
*earth wgs-84
*method rk4-fixed variable-mass
*wind geodetic file=wind_variable_mass.dat units=ft/sec
*file wind_variable_mass_trace.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*trajectory 1 wind_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=2000 alt=100 lat=0 long=0 vel=100 gama=0 psi=90
  *print time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt winde windn windd
  *segment 1 powered-through-wind
    *mass xcg=0 ixx=20 iyy=20 izz=5
    *aero sref=5.241 lrefx=2.58333 lrefy=2.58333 caxial=0.3 cnormal=0.08
    *prop x=0 thrust=30000 mdot=4
    *when time>5 goto 2
  *segment 2 wind-coast
    *ptmass
    *aero cx=0.08
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
